{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/extras/eba253077b5e8cb425c21842ada70471.avif?t=1758904021\" alt=\"Story\" width=336 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cold city of Forratis a young magician named Waldemar finds himself in a tricky situation, as an eclipse occurs that doesn't seem to stop. Since magic is bestowed by the sun's radiation, after some days it is lost completely and has thrown the city into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Waldos livelyhood is threatened, he decides to take upon a journey towards the city center, in order to confront the city's tyrannical leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one more problem: due to uprisings the city gates have been closed. Can you find a way into the city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/extras/2aee596c3785d04c958c870e6f017710.avif?t=1758904021\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=336 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this point-and-click-adventure you can explore the area of the outer city to find a way all the way into the core of the city. Talk to kind strangers, old friends and use your surroundings to your advantage. The more you look around, the more you might find.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781320?t=1758904021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/c9f09117ae7841bdcfcad9efbb0936394d7ef3fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758904021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/e9c0f3353100b7cdecf10e0a5e77d5df5c005f6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758904021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/e9c0f3353100b7cdecf10e0a5e77d5df5c005f6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758904021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/extras/eba253077b5e8cb425c21842ada70471.avif?t=1758904021\" alt=\"Story\" width=336 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cold city of Forratis a young magician named Waldemar finds himself in a tricky situation, as an eclipse occurs that doesn't seem to stop. Since magic is bestowed by the sun's radiation, after some days it is lost completely and has thrown the city into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Waldos livelyhood is threatened, he decides to take upon a journey towards the city center, in order to confront the city's tyrannical leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one more problem: due to uprisings the city gates have been closed. Can you find a way into the city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/extras/2aee596c3785d04c958c870e6f017710.avif?t=1758904021\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=336 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this point-and-click-adventure you can explore the area of the outer city to find a way all the way into the core of the city. Talk to kind strangers, old friends and use your surroundings to your advantage. The more you look around, the more you might find.</p>","developers":["LeinArtLabs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781320/c8a40e1f72f76b1c0c096379fc481e8e66b23500/header.jpg?t=